  "title": "P033 runner v1 result envelope and canonical success evidence",
  "description": "Diagnostic excluded envelopes are not admitted. Success requires complete canonical full/smoke shape. Strict JSON parsing and result_validation.validate_benchmark_result additionally enforce finite values, integer tokens (not integral floats), matrix/arithmetic/descriptor consistency, selected-candidate ties and source duplicate policy. Schema validation alone is not research admission.",
